    "segments": [
      {
        "start": 170.8,
        "end": 179.8,
        "narration": "最后一分结束，两人在网前拥抱。两个六比四，蒂亚福晋级。",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "point_end_ok": "The cold open is post-match reaction and the net embrace: full-source stills172.5–178.5 confirm it. A hard source cut180.02 starts TennisTV advertising; detected180.98 score change lies in the advertisement, not an unfinished point. Body137–179.8 replays the full final point and embrace."
      },
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 10.8,
        "narration": "北京时间十月一日下午，锦织告别东京。首轮对阵蒂亚福，零比二落后，他先保住发球局。",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5
      },
      {
        "start": 10.8,
        "end": 20.4,
        "narration": "这一分从底线打到网前。锦织连续横向补位，追回这一分，也把局分追到二比二。",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "point_end_ok": "This is an internal narration boundary only. The next source segment starts at exactly20.4 and continuously retains the same point finish and Nishikori reaction through23.7; no rally footage is removed."
      },
      {
        "start": 20.4,
        "end": 23.7,
        "narration": "",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5
      },
      {
        "start": 31.95,
        "end": 50.95,
        "narration": "锦织随后反超到三比二。但三比三这个发球局，他先被逼出三个破发点。连救两个之后，还是没能守住。蒂亚福就此重新领先。",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5
      },
      {
        "start": 50.95,
        "end": 57.35,
        "narration": "",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "point_end_ok": "The point finishes before the Tiafoe reaction close-up at hard cut56.26. The next hard cut57.26 begins the following game; detected57.99 belongs to the new scoreboard state. This segment retains the break point and reaction, not an unfinished rally."
      },
      {
        "start": 85.8,
        "end": 95.3,
        "narration": "六比四，蒂亚福先下一盘。第二盘一比一，锦织的发球局再次遇到考验。",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5
      },
      {
        "start": 99.66,
        "end": 105.5,
        "narration": "蒂亚福突然改打直线，锦织没能接回。",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5
      },
      {
        "start": 105.5,
        "end": 110.02,
        "narration": "",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5
      },
      {
        "start": 137.0,
        "end": 161.5,
        "narration": "锦织始终没能追回这一局差距。四比五的接发局，他先拿两分，蒂亚福却连追三分，拿到赛点。最后这一分，两个人仍在底线来回调动，谁也没有轻易放手。",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5
      },
      {
        "start": 161.5,
        "end": 166.6,
        "narration": "蒂亚福突然把球放短。锦织奋力前追。",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5
      },
      {
        "start": 166.6,
        "end": 170.8,
        "narration": "",
        "score_inset": true,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "point_end_ok": "This is an internal source-continuous boundary: the next segment begins at170.8 and retains result confirmation, the walk to net and embrace through179.8. The point itself ended earlier in the same uninterrupted137–179.8 block."
