        "point_end_ok": "The final source endpoint179.8 plus0.18 fade reaches179.98, just before hard cut180.02 into the TennisTV advertisement. Net embrace is visible at178.5;180.98 is an advertising frame transition, not a match point."
      },
      {
        "stat_card": true,
        "seconds": 8,
        "narration": "六比四、六比四，蒂亚福晋级。锦织这场东京告别，哪一分最让你难忘？",
